{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "刻板餘貲印訂三佰部流通"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "智者云：樹生生身，龍\n生法身，故名龍樹。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明天文地理，作寶作藥"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明修一切功德法門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明第一義，《中觀論》者是其一品，即《大智度論》是也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出《付法藏經》、《摩訶羅經》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第十三卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大智度論．中觀一品"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在藏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圓\n\n十住"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十信"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今福嚴寺是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今嶽君塑像猶在石鼓之上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "事具本傳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "高麗別名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附：清規"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無機子頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附：石室藏書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐末教典流散海外，本朝咸平三年，日本國寂照持此本至四明，慈雲得之，為作序云：初\n卷開止觀之解，次卷示止觀之行。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大品四十二字，初「阿」後「荼」，南嶽用對四十二位。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四明行皎遊方至南嶽福嚴，於藏中得此本歸，以示圓辯。其後北峯、石芝始獲開板。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上各一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "右《止觀》、《安樂行義》、《願文》有見本，餘不復見，惜哉！"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "名圓頓止觀。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "名漸次止觀。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "名不定止觀。智者為陳尚書令毛喜撰。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "解曇無讖譯四卷別行之本。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋《法華．普門》一品，別行部外。昔曇無讖勸河西王誦\n\n持愈疾，故智者特釋。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "建炎二年，武林修悟將此疏入經為注。咸淳元年，南\n湖行靖等將天台法輪院科《金剛經》并疏刊板于寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《金剛》、《彌陀》二疏雖曾入藏，而孤山淨覺謂是附托之文，唯\n神照法師嘗於法輪用此疏講，有宣賜本在東山藏中。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "智者親撰。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上皆親撰。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《維摩玄疏》離出之文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十八卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為煬帝撰。荊溪略為十卷，但稱《畧疏》，與前《玄疏》各行。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《天竺別集》云：元豐初得之海賈。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上各一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈雲《隨函錄》云：「《法華玄義》者，唯解首題，統明五時，廣辯八教，出世大意蘊在其中。《文句》者，\n以疏句分節經文。」荊溪云：「以由釋題，大意委悉，故至經文麄分章段。」隨部各有荊溪之記，\n猶五經之有正義也。《止觀》者，定慧之異名，《法華》之行門也。前《玄義文句》，皆明佛世當機得\n\n益之事，縱有托事附法觀心之文，非部正意。今《止觀》正是智者說己心中所行法門，自行\n因果，化他能所，無不具焉。荊溪以《輔行》釋之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《目錄》云：今家有三種止觀。一曰漸次，謂解\n頓行漸，即禪波羅蜜是也。二曰不定，謂解頓，行或頓或漸，即六妙門是也。三曰圓漸，謂解\n行俱頓，即摩訶止觀是也。此三止觀對根不同，行相雖殊，俱依圓理而為宗本。唐梁肅刪\n止觀為六卷，文雖𥳑要，而修相多闕，覽者宜知。除智者親筆，餘皆章安於法輪之下，述為\n疏論也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《唐書．藝文志》云：灌頂私記智者詞旨一卷，義記一卷，今未詳何文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《釋籤》云：《止\n觀》、《禪門》、《淨名疏》等，各有餘分說未終者。文案：《止觀》云，智者於玉泉寺一夏敷揚，二時慈霔。\n雖樂說不窮，纔至見境，法輪停轉，後分弗宣。《輔行》云，大章第七，開為十境。至第七境，餘不\n復宣。後三大章及餘三境，時逼夏終，於茲罷唱。《次第禪門》，即《禪波羅蜜》，忽列十大章，於第\n\n六方便文中，注云：若論初禪已後，發諸禪定深妙境界，並在第七修證中說，此文皆悉不\n流通也。《淨名經》十四品，大師疏解，止〈佛道品〉，第八後諸品疏，乃是章安述而續之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一十卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "荊溪治定十五卷，今十八卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈雲目錄云：考其所說，知入品位，然江浙名流或云疑偽。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別傳《百錄》是大師始終化迹。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亡。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亡。○除亡本外，有二十卷入藏。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今開二十卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈雲云：為初學難解及破異論。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為司封李華出。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "略智者《維摩文疏》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈雲云：對廣文雖少殊，亦釋義宛合。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明涅槃佛性義。已上四十九卷，同入大藏。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋籤部外別行。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亡。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亡。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亡。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亡。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亡。今東山有板二卷，是海東復還者。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "皓師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "曠師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "滿師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敏師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彧師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "靖師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋《光明玄》略本。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋《十不二門》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圓師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "小本"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上各一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋《請觀音經疏》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋《光明文句》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋《涅槃疏》金剛身百非義。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋《觀經疏》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋《涅槃玄義》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋《淨名略疏》二。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋《光明玄》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋《涅槃疏》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋《金錍》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋《十不二門》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋圭峯《蘭盆疏》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋自撰《彌陀疏》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋自撰《楞嚴經疏》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋自撰《文殊般若經疏》，大論㭊重令輕取此義。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋自撰《心經疏》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孤山年二十一，始學于奉先清師。及二年奉先亡，遂往孤山杜門養病，年四十七而化，於\n二十四年著書百二十卷，勤矣！"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "石芝云：四明承用其義於《妙宗鈔》中，故無可傳之文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "指南云：請尋寶雲《備急鈔》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廣智續記《讚佛品》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "石芝撰《四明教行錄》，備載別理隨緣，融心解，消伏三用，起信論融會章，義例境觀及問答\n等文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "式師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "依《百錄》本。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《靈苑集》、《采遺集》附。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "淨師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "杲師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "岳師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
